{"id":"u126","kelas":"travel","no":5,"judul":"Belanja dan Uang","title":"Shopping and Money","emoji":"🛍️","ringkas":"Harga, menawar, menukar uang, kartu, dan pengembalian","ready":true,"goals":["bertanya **harga, ukuran, dan diskon** di toko luar negeri","memakai kata untuk **uang dan pembayaran**: exchange rate, change, receipt","meminta **pengembalian atau penukaran** barang dengan sopan","memakai pola *How much is ...?* dan *Do you have this in ...?*"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Berbelanja di luar negeri berarti menanyakan harga, mencoba barang, dan membayar. Pelajari kata penting dan pola kalimat sopannya."},{"t":"vocab","title":"1. Harga dan uang","items":[{"en":"exchange rate","id":"nilai tukar","ex":"What is the exchange rate today?"},{"en":"cash","id":"uang tunai","ex":"Do you accept cash?"},{"en":"credit card","id":"kartu kredit","ex":"I will pay by credit card."},{"en":"change","id":"uang kembalian","ex":"Here is your change."},{"en":"receipt","id":"struk","ex":"Could I have a receipt, please?"},{"en":"price tag","id":"label harga","ex":"I cannot see the price tag."},{"en":"cheaper","id":"lebih murah","ex":"Do you have a cheaper one?"},{"en":"in total","id":"secara total","ex":"That is fifty dollars in total."}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"2. Di toko","items":[{"en":"fitting room","id":"ruang ganti","ex":"Where is the fitting room?"},{"en":"try on","id":"mencoba pakaian","ex":"Can I try this on?"},{"en":"size","id":"ukuran","ex":"Do you have this in a larger size?"},{"en":"colour","id":"warna","ex":"Does it come in another colour?"},{"en":"on sale","id":"sedang diskon","ex":"These shoes are on sale."},{"en":"discount","id":"potongan harga","ex":"Is there a discount?"},{"en":"out of stock","id":"kehabisan stok","ex":"Sorry, this size is out of stock."},{"en":"gift wrap","id":"bungkus kado","ex":"Could you gift wrap it, please?"}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Masalah dan pengembalian","items":[{"en":"refund","id":"pengembalian uang","ex":"I would like a refund."